{"article":{"id":360016260113,"url":"https://etsy.zendesk.com/api/v2/help_center/en-us/articles/360016260113.json","html_url":"https://help.etsy.com/hc/en-us/articles/360016260113-How-to-Edit-Your-Listing-Photos","author_id":365809011168,"comments_disabled":true,"draft":false,"promoted":false,"position":0,"vote_sum":-1467,"vote_count":3573,"upvote_count":1053,"downvote_count":2520,"section_id":360000066967,"created_at":"2019-01-24T22:05:43Z","updated_at":"2026-10-27T00:39:54Z","name":"How to Edit Your Listing Photos","title":"How to Edit Your Listing Photos","source_locale":"en-us","locale":"en-us","outdated":false,"outdated_locales":[],"edited_at":"2026-06-29T20:40:47Z","user_segment_id":null,"permission_group_id":972313,"content_tag_ids":[],"label_names":["seller"],"body":"<div class=\"zd-note\"><p>Did you know you can add videos of your items? <a href=\"https://www.etsy.com/seller-handbook/article/how-to-take-listing-videos-with-your/821069114343?ref=vg20sh\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Learn how to attract shoppers with listing videos</a>.</p></div><p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">When you add photos to </span><a href=\"https://help.etsy.com/hc/articles/115015628707\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">your listings</span></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, you can change their order, crop them, edit them, and adjust the thumbnail. </span><span style=\"color: #222222;\">The thumbnail is a cropped version of your primary listing photo that may be seen in different places across Etsy.</span></p><p><span style=\"color: #222222;\">Having multiple clear, high-resolution images in your listing is an important factor for your listings’ quality. Having a main image that is too dark, blurry, or are part of a photo-collage may result in your listing appearing lower in Etsy search results.  </span></p><ul>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea57954e7ff20f19a351c79d0906d20dc\">\n<span style=\"color: #222222;\">Learn more about </span><a href=\"https://help.etsy.com/hc/articles/360036207794-What-are-Etsy-s-Customer-Service-Standards?segment=selling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Etsy’s Customer Service Standards</a><span style=\"color: #222222;\">.</span>\n</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee6f8709a55092aef312a12c7df97a5fa\">\n<span style=\"color: #222222;\">Learn more about </span><a style=\"background-color: #ffffff; font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;\" href=\"https://help.etsy.com/hc/articles/115015663347\">requirements for listing photos</a><span style=\"color: #222222;\">.</span>\n</li>\n</ul><p><span style=\"color: #222222;\">While your listing photos upload to the Etsy Seller app, you can complete the remaining listing information. You'll receive a notification if any of your photos failed to upload and you need to try again. Once your photos have successfully uploaded, you can begin to edit them.</span></p><h2 id=\"h_01H9NYXD7SY7NGNX20CS8BJ30Q\">How to change the order of your listing photos</h2><p>The first photo will be the thumbnail for your listing. You can change the order of your photos on your listing if you’d like a different one to be first.</p><p><button class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-content-toggle--with-icon\" data-wt-content-toggle=\"\" aria-controls=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2a\" type=\"button\">To change the order of your photos on Etsy.com:<span class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn__icon\"></span> </button></p><div class=\"wt-content-toggle__body\" id=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2a\"><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ecc4045c399eb4fc5f7bb4a84a42875b7\">On Etsy.com, open <strong>Shop Manager</strong>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e0039e3019458365a57be5eb210e2a7f1\">Choose <a href=\"https://www.etsy.com/your/shops/me/tools/listings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Listings</strong></a>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e3839010bdc724a7764375de65a46c264\">\n<a href=\"https://help.etsy.com/hc/articles/115015692667?segment=selling\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Edit your listing</a> or create a new listing.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee5b7fd809fa7c3bc3ee32b01017eb8f2\">After you’ve added at least 2 images to the <strong>Photos</strong> section, select and drag them to change the order.</li>\n</ol></div><p><button class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-content-toggle--with-icon\" data-wt-content-toggle=\"\" aria-controls=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2b\" type=\"button\">To change the order of your photos on the Etsy Seller app:<span class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn__icon\"></span> </button></p><div class=\"wt-content-toggle__body\" id=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2b\"><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ec2c7aa1714525fe9e2ef2011433f2907\">Open the listing and tap a photo or the <strong>Listing</strong> heading.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e9a33022bf7e32962199e09abe0868895\">Tap <strong>View all</strong>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ee62b7a14023dd740162da597b20a8c73\">Tap <strong>Reorder</strong>.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e395d3ee422debf17c7e0c8abcba9ddda\">Tap and drag a photo.</li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e9b6e2ab8c94767b14fd26eae4e0e08a1\">Choose <strong>Save</strong>.</li>\n</ol></div><h2 id=\"h_01H9NYXD7S4FMTNZR4R0BVSW16\">How to crop your listing photos</h2><p><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #222222;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">You can crop your photos after you add them to your listing. Cropping can change how the thumbnail looks, so try cropping before adjusting your thumbnail.</span></span></p><p><button class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-content-toggle--with-icon\" data-wt-content-toggle=\"\" aria-controls=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2e\" type=\"button\">To crop listing photos on Etsy.com:<span class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn__icon\"></span> </button></p><div class=\"wt-content-toggle__body\" id=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2e\"><ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"ebc669d3df860087adbe68eac0ef090bf\">Open <strong>Shop Manager.</strong>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"e192e8946e7b9127b6fab222b52ed8bc7\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choose </span><a href=\"https://www.etsy.com/your/shops/me/tools/listings\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"><strong>Listings</strong></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"edc305281ff8c17ee5d197d7ca3192874\">\n<a href=\"https://help.etsy.com/hc/articles/115015692667\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Edit your listing</a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or create a new listing.</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"e5492e88e97bc8947f9f44f75bab1eb0d\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Hover over the photo.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"e16e54c0a7e711e1a1c6d6979b2b86fc1\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choose the crop icon.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"efc2880815006250052430e1aae85119d\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Select any one of the suggested sizes or drag the grid's corners to choose your own size.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"ecc624da14ff3886bda2c1bdb2bdb952a\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Select </span><strong>Save</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span>\n</li>\n</ol></div><p><button class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-content-toggle--with-icon\" data-wt-content-toggle=\"\" aria-controls=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2f\" type=\"button\">To crop listing photos on the Etsy Seller app:<span class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn__icon\"></span> </button></p><div class=\"wt-content-toggle__body\" id=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2f\"><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e7ad31999abd9b15ee36a4ffca7009b84\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Open your listing and tap a listing photo.</span></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e8ff3639c61e5e0e8980885ea48e894e7\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tap <strong>Edit</strong>.</span></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"ea9e65dc15415bd4747b32ec883e81bbf\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Drag the corners to resize the image or choose <strong>Original</strong> for preset sizes.</span></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e6de35fed338965972aefb0158af9e93f\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Slide the image to choose what part you want to display.</span></li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e40156c89f685d46a5519618ae320e72b\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Tap <strong>Apply</strong>.</span></li>\n</ol></div><p>You won’t be able to undo the crop after you save it. To undo the crop, <span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #222222;\">upload the original image again.</span><span style=\"background-color: #ffffff; color: #222222;\"></span></p><h2 id=\"h_01JSCYSKDPBR918XC7SK08Q2J8\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">How to edit your listing photos</span></h2><p><span style=\"color: #222222;\">Etsy has partnered with Img.ly so you can edit your listing photos on the Etsy Seller app with just a few taps.</span></p><p><button class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-content-toggle--with-icon\" data-wt-content-toggle=\"\" aria-controls=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2g\" type=\"button\">To edit your listing photos on the Etsy Seller app:<span class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn__icon\"></span> </button></p><div class=\"wt-content-toggle__body\" id=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2g\"><ol>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: #222222;\" data-list-item-id=\"e475c01186d69be48585d3900f2af2776\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">In<strong> Listings</strong>, select the listing you wish to edit or create a new one. </span></li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: #222222;\" data-list-item-id=\"e1aa7829d0666a1115bea2a3893974594\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">Go to <strong>Photo and video</strong> and select the photo or videos you wish to edit, or add a new one. Select <strong>Edit</strong>.</span></li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: #222222;\" data-list-item-id=\"ea690dbc490e73f5cfcbb1bbe123a416c\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">Select <strong>Transform</strong> to crop or rotate, or <strong>Adjust </strong>to edit brightness, contrast, saturation, sharpness, and more. </span></li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: #222222;\" data-list-item-id=\"e714e603aed3d67a18939f82acd156cb4\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">Select the check mark in the top right corner when finished editing.</span></li>\n</ol></div><p><span style=\"color: #222222;\">If you have preferred photo edits, save them as a custom photo filter. Saving your custom photo filters can make editing easier and help give your listing photos a cohesive look.</span></p><p><button class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-content-toggle--with-icon\" data-wt-content-toggle=\"\" aria-controls=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2h\" type=\"button\">To save your edit as a custom photo filter on the Etsy Seller app:<span class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn__icon\"></span> </button></p><div class=\"wt-content-toggle__body\" id=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2h\"><ol>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: #222222;\" data-list-item-id=\"edf2c1075414dec4c9c6ded3376e9566b\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">After editing your listing image, select <strong>Create a filter </strong>to save it.</span></li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: #222222;\" data-list-item-id=\"efa139b0c90dee1202783178ac927a9ba\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">Provide your custom photo filter with a name under <strong>Filter name</strong>.</span></li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: #222222;\" data-list-item-id=\"e5edc85ed0592d3c31bf0386fb5171c93\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">Select <strong>Save</strong>.</span></li>\n</ol></div><p><button class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-content-toggle--with-icon\" data-wt-content-toggle=\"\" aria-controls=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2i\" type=\"button\">To apply a custom photo filter to your listing image on the Etsy Seller app:<span class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn__icon\"></span> </button></p><div class=\"wt-content-toggle__body\" id=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2i\"><ol>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: #222222;\" data-list-item-id=\"ea33e0d24217a3a8d3131243c277a63cc\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">When editing an image, select <strong>Apply a photo filter</strong>. </span></li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: #222222;\" data-list-item-id=\"e4471af30394c7950eab3c7ddc35f6696\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">Choose the filter you want from your list of custom photo filters.</span></li>\n</ol></div><p><span style=\"color: #222222;\">Your custom photo filters will show up in order from most to least recently used. </span></p><p><span style=\"color: #222222;\">If you delete a custom photo filter, the images that have been edited with the filter will not be impacted.</span></p><h2 id=\"h_01H9NYXD7SSTJQN22Y5PJKXCVG\">How to adjust your thumbnail</h2><p><button class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn wt-btn wt-btn--transparent wt-content-toggle--with-icon\" data-wt-content-toggle=\"\" aria-controls=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2c\" type=\"button\">To adjust your thumbnail on Etsy.com:<span class=\"wt-content-toggle--btn__icon\"></span> </button></p><div class=\"wt-content-toggle__body\" id=\"wt-content-toggle-example-2c\"><ol>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"edd8a7dddeac52184d28123275d0dbe78\">Open <strong>Shop Manager.</strong>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"e724a995fd916e9d4ebb08e975dbe3e05\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choose </span><a href=\"https://www.etsy.com/your/shops/me/tools/listings\"><strong>Listings</strong></a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"ea92811ed2f7d267b92de370cf1e321e0\">\n<a href=\"https://help.etsy.com/hc/articles/115015692667\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Edit your listing</a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or create a new listing.</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"e8ebb8caa0440d34c7e1ac80742dacc48\">\n<span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Choose </span><strong>Adjust Thumbnail</strong><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">.</span>\n</li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"edb0070c0339877acc7c67a17f2fbe95f\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Slide the circular button left and right to zoom in and out.</span></li>\n<li class=\"wysiwyg-list-color\" style=\"--wysiwyg-list-marker-color: #222222;\" data-list-item-id=\"e66d5951fb80fd2283d768dd5c9723b02\"><span style=\"color: #222222;\">Position your image so your subject is clear in all 3 views used across Etsy.</span></li>\n<li style=\"font-weight: 400;\" data-list-item-id=\"e8b412f9af9b6229235bc8ec12f206e35\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Select <strong>Apply</strong>.</span></li>\n</ol></div><h2 id=\"h_01J85S6EA6QAK9YVPEF9TGWRB9\"><strong>How to fix your listings’ images for Etsy search visibility  </strong></h2><p>To view which of your listings have images that may be causing Etsy search visibility problems: </p><ol>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e6425890d5488474a9baf0b4ae6e74dbb\">From your <strong>Shop Manager</strong>, visit your <a href=\"https://www.etsy.com/your/shops/me/search-visibility?ref=seller-platform-mcnav\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Etsy Search visibility page</a>. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e924628e3d7cd5dbb93727a760e0209c4\">In the <strong>Your listings </strong>section, you’ll see personalized insights and recommendations on how to improve your listings. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"e722b18cb864202c639ea68fc53f5965d\">Choose an issue you want to correct and select <strong>View listings</strong>. This shows all the listings in your shop with that issue. </li>\n<li data-list-item-id=\"eaa242e77e0c4024274c29902ddf4dffe\">Multiple issues may affect an individual listing. Once all the issues are resolved, they will no longer appear in your <strong>Etsy Search visibility </strong>page. </li>\n</ol><p><span style=\"color: #222222;\"> Once improvements have been made, the insights will typically disappear within 24 hours.</span></p>","user_segment_ids":[]}}